abstract: >-
  Turns raw SUMO (vehicle mobility) and OMNeT++ (cellular network)
  simulation output into a labeled, AI-ready dataset of cellular
  handover/migration events, for training cellular handover / migration
  prediction models. Seven Jupyter notebooks cover the pipeline from raw
  simulator output to the labeled dataset, plus a master orchestrator
  notebook (run_pipeline.ipynb) that runs the whole chain in one call.
